{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>By decree of</b> — thus they decreed, for they are the ministers of HaShem, as He commanded them and the matter of the holy ones. And the question is: why? In order that the living may know that the Most High is HaShem, who rules over the kingdom of men, and gives it to whomsoever He wills, and sets over it the lowliest of men."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:19:48.836935374Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}